@host = http://localhost:5080

### 查看端点
GET {{host}}/

### 将 JSON 编码为二进制，并在 IDE 中保存响应体
POST {{host}}/api/packets/encode
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 42,
  "deviceCode": "DEVICE-01",
  "payloadHex": "A10BFF",
  "deviceTime": "2026-08-20T14:30:15.123",
  "billingTime": "2026-08-20T14:30:15",
  "createdAt": "2026-08-20T06:30:15Z",
  "timeOfDay": "14:30:00",
  "description": "上海一号设备",
  "samples": [10, 20, 30]
}

### 解码时，请把 encode 的二进制响应保存为 device-packet.bin
POST {{host}}/api/packets/decode
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

< ./device-packet.bin
